{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年30歲的「大馬女神」林宣妤（Serene）在2017年參選《國際中華小姐》奪得亞軍後簽約TVB，備受力捧，其後她因未能適應香港生活節奏而離巢回流馬來西亞發展，直至2021年初簽約成為李澤楷旗下經理人公司藝人，一躍成為「楷女郎」。一向形象甜美、氣質清純的林宣妤，日前在社交平台分享近照，大膽挑戰前衛漂眉造型，但就引來不少網民擔憂，直指她身形暴瘦，狀態大跌Watt！</p><figure><img alt=\"「大馬女神」林宣妤（Serene）。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251022/1057738154548924416306921.jpeg/DtFs3vrmjOHcuvU4YshYbu3si-TCzOfUIBnz6iAZ8-o\"/><figcaption>「大馬女神」林宣妤（Serene）。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林宣妤在TVB劇集《使徒行者3》中與林峯有大量對手戲，備受力捧。（劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210328/452951871863263232420679.jpeg/hqm9NZyJRd6OWZGc9lH0fkgC09iJztRhcGpqXXBqal0\"/><figcaption>林宣妤在TVB劇集《使徒行者3》中與林峯有大量對手戲，備受力捧。（劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林宣妤是不少網民心目中的女神。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231105/797842501821927424081472.jpeg/816ey4EnM60WZ4eXvzJsJbU4EPHv5bajPcM-1j3DPtY\"/><figcaption>林宣妤是不少網民心目中的女神。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林宣妤是不少網民心目中的女神。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231105/797842506993766400370219.jpeg/k0wy2uZIUg0q8kHb_NhWw-XQE2Ew1pOvUdZkBVHWZAU\"/><figcaption>林宣妤是不少網民心目中的女神。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"氣質清純。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194340640251449344759236.jpeg/6YJBI_OEJF8LWmvtjuW4HvZZrvGVfMFLIlRcoiJUXKI\"/><figcaption>氣質清純。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬長腿。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194340646039851008123984.jpeg/qsYUE0CpBTO8mbaZmqZ4lu-g6fYtnAdsmHWcOph1nDo\"/><figcaption>大曬長腿。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"度假。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251022/1057738794096267264614529.jpeg/UHdpxS6t2oKq5yO8mcu9Rkq1Eydbntvv-3XeSPt13kg\"/><figcaption>度假。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><p>林宣妤挑戰前衛「無眉妝」　面容凹陷仙氣盡失</p><p>林宣妤在IG分享近照，並寫道：「Embracing my bleached brows era. Might just keep them even after the shoot🤓（擁抱我的漂眉時代。拍攝結束後我可能還會保留它們。）」相中所見，林宣妤將原本的眉毛漂白，轉為時下歐美前衛的「Bleached Brows」無眉造型。不過該妝容顯得格格不入，令她整個人看起來神情憔悴、面無血色，仙氣盡失。</p><figure><img alt=\"漂眉造型。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194339926599012352427158.jpeg/23wEMXhUW94nS2kEeJaCDY2iP-9KhqT_uEsR4rhLEeI\"/><figcaption>漂眉造型。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身形瘦削。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194339951974682624804791.jpeg/ZYx_EQZqy_WOQNfOrf9BnJzzMITz8TzbIaYvtyGmL7c\"/><figcaption>身形瘦削。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青筋盡現。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194339962670551040963758.jpeg/rimxB2YxgUJ3BthNSho_1iH7mFNDnrVUjwGIc48BiHM\"/><figcaption>青筋盡現。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"面無血色。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194339958606139392498615.jpeg/xhBisaHza2JyTRADH2RlBWJaWWoHqk97uac5ebmnOXk\"/><figcaption>面無血色。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"胸骨突出。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194339948807852032598346.jpeg/xcL5kEEe8zeZh7oW_cjwc9n2Ah-9L-qmCuIZ1griGdY\"/><figcaption>胸骨突出。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><p>林宣妤身形暴瘦胸骨明顯　曾患暴食症靠做運動走出陰霾</p><p>除了眉毛造型引起熱議之外，林宣妤單薄消瘦的身形亦成為焦點，當日她身穿淡黃色V領喱士連身裙，胸前鎖骨及胸骨分明突出，手臂更是纖細如柴，雙腿亦極為瘦削，網民紛紛留言表示認為她身形過瘦，令人擔憂：「How come look so thin」、「you too slim. eat more food」、「以前好靚，搞成咁」。其實林宣妤當年初來港發展時，因未能適應節奏急速的生活而壓力過大，慘受暴食症折磨，後來改善生活習慣，堅持做運動，終於走出陰霾！</p><figure><img alt=\"過往身形勻稱。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251022/1057738791214649344527801.jpeg/6Zip8sCExYCy7r_qp8OcMogVDZC2yMbCDszHiw7Mx4s\"/><figcaption>過往身形勻稱。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"激罕曬泳照。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251022/1057738798152159232081752.jpeg/limp-YzvRV_CvW-SJ38Z1lZQ1R_1P8ZsGxmM6xsZjOs\"/><figcaption>激罕曬泳照。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"優雅。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194340651123609600341082.jpeg/7EIPIRuOs7JcSVSPHbvEREn58dUmvjFuAmF7YAJhe2A\"/><figcaption>優雅。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"五官標緻。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194340648661422080368902.jpeg/n9geRC9vR8A1wDCiIR-hN3G6J8ceG39NkAgW95AIFvc\"/><figcaption>五官標緻。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林宣妤一家顏值爆燈。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194340643699298304375642.jpeg/WlFsuu_ZVdUWA7vv7H-ujFzWRGdy5CjNqu2Dmartg5k\"/><figcaption>林宣妤一家顏值爆燈。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林宣妤一家顏值爆燈。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194340641262276608302568.jpeg/RHxVLKEtzvYnE2p0rh6C2TS4eEeazlr1pYA_N6WAPzc\"/><figcaption>林宣妤一家顏值爆燈。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"堅持做運動。（IG@serene_lsy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194354168274358272519283.jpeg/G9mobzlsIJBfyj0KP2nwtnitT-6BeqtN6AChs-gAobM\"/><figcaption>堅持做運動。（IG@serene_lsy）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T22:20:39.976639+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1113,"images":19,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T22:00:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:18:46.398727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T22:18:29.600819+00:00","content_hash":"d793f343c60f382a7046c20ed1dfe61c47c2fef016abe0ccf1aa2529c8c4a920","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}